l'ULZX'"h8pq:'PFJsDhWy
tH4ThY:aJrNAqc.?;TNuyD</b>
<b>King Cobra Assassinated</b>

247
00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.120
They were celebrating
because they thought

248
00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.800
I'd assassinated King Cobra.

249
00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:03.700
<b>vNQ:PQi:NJVks,iKz"o;;!
zumrvujOVRk!iLyB5!aQs!
rRewifl:BM84OKbL5qOc3! 4NzbI8BoNQ?feZdt1eSS6E
l'ULZX'"h8pq:'PFJsDhWy
tH4ThY:aJrNAqc.?;TNuyD</b>
<b>King Cobra Assassinated</b>

250
00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:09.570
What could I say to them when
they were all cheering for me?

251
00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:11.810
I wanted to tell them
the truth, of course,

252
00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.590
and yet I held my tongue.

253
00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:16.720
Because I felt their hunger
for revolution.

254
00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.160
Hm?

255
00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.150
We can thank Betty for that.

256
00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:22.310
When they met her,

257
00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.640
plenty of them wanted to join
the Revolutionary Army.

258
00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:28.410
Those are the ones I
brought here on the ship.

259
00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:33.150
At the time, I wasn't
able to get my hands

260
00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:35.440
on an encrypted
Transponder Snail.

261
00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:37.650
Which is why I
didn't contact you.

262
00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:39.970
Not till we set sail at least.

263
00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:44.990
<b>Kamabakka
Queendom</b>
<b>Kingdom of Lulusia</b>

264
00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.730
That's when I sent
you a relay message,

265
00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.430
which I'm sure seemed odd.

266
00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:49.230
Dragon, it's true
that King Cobra is dead...

267
00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:53.010
...but I didn't kill him.

268
00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:55.830
<b>Kamabakka
Queendom</b>

269
00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:56.680
Since it wasn't encrypted,

270
00:14:55.870 --> 00:15:00.800
<b>Kingdom of Lulusia</b>

271
00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.880
the Government likely
intercepted the call

272
00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.070
and thought I was in Lulusia.

273
00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:04.950
But in reality, I was already
out at sea with the enlistees.

274
00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:08.950
And Lulusia was destroyed when
you were on the call with us.

275
00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.350
My, must have been
traumatic for those on board.

276
00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:17.500
Yeah. Everyone on the ship
went into a panic.

277
00:15:17.670 --> 00:15:20.930
So many of them had just
left their families behind.

278
00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.470
And then right
before their eyes,

279
00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:25.340
everything was
wiped out in a flash.

280
00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.680
I'm sure they
were devastated.

281
00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:31.470
Can you try to explain
what you saw?

282
00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:35.540
A massive shadow
covered the sky.

283
00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:42.060
It came out of nowhere.
And then, only a moment later...

284
00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:55.640
What do
you mean, a shadow?

285
00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:57.100
I couldn't make it out,

286
00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.300
because it was flying
above the clouds.

287
00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:02.980
But it was something dark,
something unnatural.

288
00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:09.070
The person you saw.

289
00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.660
You said their name was
"Imu," is that correct?

290
00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:12.750
Yeah.

291
00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.190
Well, this might
sound rather bizarre,

292
00:16:15.980 --> 00:16:17.820
but that name has history.

293
00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:19.360
Eight hundred years ago,

294
00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.860
there was a ruler among
the First Twenty,

295
00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:25.050
Saint Imu of
the Nerona Dynasty.

296
00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.750
Look at this.

297
00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.420
You've heard the story.

298
00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.880
There is an ability that can make
someone immortal, they say.

299
00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.870
And it seems we've
found that someone.

300
00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.320
They don't know death,

301
00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.990
and they're the one calling
the shots at the top of the world.

302
00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:46.840
You think that's the person
I saw? The same Imu?

303
00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:49.680
It could be a coincidence,
but that seems unlikely.

304
00:16:49.760 --> 00:16:52.970
The Five Elders, who stand above
even the Celestial Dragons,

305
00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:55.140
humble themselves
before Imu.

306
00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.250
Who else could claim
an authority like that,

307
00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.280
commanding the self-proclaimed
descendants of gods?

308
00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:03.200
One more thing!

309
00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:05.390
And this one is terrifying, too!

310
00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:06.820
That shadow you
saw in the sky

311
00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.360
is likely a secret
Government weapon.

312
00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.700
But who could create
something so powerful?

313
00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:15.800
A genius, that's who!
What if it was Vegapunk?

314
00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.260
That doesn't make sense.

315
00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:18.440
Perhaps he could,

316
00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:22.110
but Vegapunk would never design
a weapon to commit mass-murder.

317
00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:23.290
I know!

318
00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:28.430
But in that case, it must
be an Ancient Weapon.

319
00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:33.260
If Imu is an ancient human,
then that's hardly a big leap!

320
00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.660
Well, we do know that
the Ancient Weapons exist.

321
00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.280
Robin confirmed as much.

322
00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.630
And yet, if the Government's
had one for so long,

323
00:17:43.850 --> 00:17:46.900
then why haven't they
tried to use it before?

324
00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.370
And why are they
using it now?

325
00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.280
We return
to the present day.

326
00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:02.560
A Celestial Dragon has been
executed in Mary Geoise.

327
00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:04.280
However, this shocking event

328
00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.780
will never be reported
to the world.

329
00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.030
Good riddance!

330
00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:10.450
That traitor sided
against his own people!

331
00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:13.200
Now those filthy creatures
are pushing their luck!

332
00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.690
He got what he deserved!

333
00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.760
Now
we can't even eat properly,

334
00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:19.710
and it's all his fault!

335
00:18:19.710 --> 00:18:21.990
The judge was
a man famous for his exploits

336
00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:24.890
on an island known
as God Valley.

337
00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:28.800
He is the Supreme Commander
of the Holy Knights.

338
00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:34.790
His name:
Saint Figarland Garling.

339
00:18:34.930 --> 00:18:39.330
And the man he executed was
the defender of the fishmen:

340
00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:42.950
Saint Donquixote Mjosgard.

341
00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:47.400
Stand up for subhuman scum
and you sink even lower.
